{"chunk_id": "4531192fdfef", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "全球原油市场供给格局", "date_hint": "", "text": "（资料来源：BP能源统计，海通证券研究所）\n2021年，全球原油产量8988万桶/天（约42.21亿吨/年）。其中，OPEC占据市场份额约35%。美国、沙特、俄罗斯是三大石油巨头，其合计市场份额为43%。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "4531192fdfef", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
